from ground_author import *
source('keller-mixing','凱勒：濕式深層攪拌','Keller: Wet Soil Mixing','Keller Group','https://www.keller.com/expertise/techniques/wet-soil-mixing','公開深層攪拌用途與品質驗證項目；本課配比及操作數字是教學假設，不是設備設定。','Public deep-mixing applications and quality-verification items; course proportions and process values are teaching assumptions, not machine settings.')
add('b187','攪拌均勻度、膠結反應與複合地盤沉陷~Mixing uniformity, binder reaction and composite-ground settlement','深層攪拌以機械拌合將膠結材料送入原土，效果由土樣反應性、材料量與攪拌分布共同決定。本課不把轉速或水泥用量當品質保證，而是連結含水比、柱體幾何、重疊、剛度及脆性，配合取樣統計和地盤變形建立材料到整體性能的驗證。~Deep mixing mechanically combines binder with native soil, with results governed by reactivity, dosage and mixing distribution. The course treats neither rotation rate nor cement quantity as a quality guarantee, linking water content, geometry, overlap, stiffness and brittleness to sampling statistics and ground movement from material to system performance.',compact(r'''
原土含水比~Native-soil water content || 原土水分影響膠結材料稀釋、混合阻力與固化後孔隙結構，含水比須以乾土質量作分母。不同土層即使加入相同膠結材量，也可能有不同水膠比及反應性；有機物、鹽分與黏土礦物更會改變強度發展，不能只按深度統一配比。~Native water affects binder dilution, mixing resistance and cured pore structure, with water content defined relative to dry soil mass. Equal binder dosage in different layers can produce different water-binder ratios and reactivity. Organics, salinity and clay minerals further alter strength development, so depth alone cannot justify one universal mixture. || 假設水質量Mw=60 kg、乾土Ms=100 kg，含水比w=Mw/Ms=0.60=60%~For water mass Mw=60 kg and dry soil mass Ms=100 kg, water content w=Mw/Ms=0.60=60% || 分層取樣量測含水與乾密度，配合有機質及反應試驗，保留取樣擾動與地下水資訊。~Sample by stratum for water content and dry density, adding organic-content and reactivity tests and retaining disturbance and groundwater information. || 誤用濕土當分母會低估含水比，配比設計因此可能過稀，造成強度及均勻性不足。~Using wet soil as the denominator understates water content and can produce an overly dilute design with inadequate strength and uniformity. || 含水比是水質量除以濕土總質量。~Water content equals water mass divided by total wet-soil mass. || 室內配比須對應代表性各土層；材料與地工設計者核准樣本範圍後，才能把試驗關係用於現場。~Laboratory mixtures must represent each relevant layer; materials and geotechnical designers approve sampling coverage before applying correlations to the field. || 含水比不是飽和度或孔隙比，也不能單獨預測水泥土強度；配比需另計新增漿液水與膠結材料質量。~Water content is neither saturation nor void ratio and does not predict soil-cement strength alone; added slurry water and binder mass require separate accounting.
膠結材用量~Binder dosage || 膠結材通常以每立方公尺原土的乾質量表示，但必須明確說明體積基準與材料留存。投入量只能描述供料，成品強度還受混合均勻、反應時間及土種影響；流量計與密度計誤差可能沿整根柱累積而不易被外觀發現。~Binder dosage commonly uses dry mass per cubic metre of native ground, requiring an explicit volume basis and retention assumption. Input describes supply, while strength also depends on uniformity, reaction time and soil type. Flow and density errors can accumulate along a column without producing visible surface evidence. || 假設乾膠結材用量b=150 kg/m³、原土體積V=20 m³，需求質量M=bV=3000 kg~For dry binder dosage b=150 kg/m³ and native-ground volume V=20 m³, mass M=bV=3000 kg || 校正供料質量、漿液密度及流量，按深度計算乾膠結材量，核對儲槽與現場紀錄。~Calibrate feed mass, slurry density and flow, calculate dry dosage by depth, and reconcile tank and field records. || 流量計失準或密度變化可使名目用量合格而實際不足，形成局部弱層及承載不連續。~Flow-meter drift or density changes can give compliant nominal dosage but inadequate actual binder, producing weak layers and interrupted resistance. || 每立方公尺加入相同水泥量就一定有相同強度。~Equal cement dosage per cubic metre guarantees equal strength. || 每柱供料紀錄應與試體及地層編碼連結；材料負責人查明量平衡偏差後，由設計者確認是否需補證。~Link each column supply log to samples and strata; after the materials lead investigates imbalance, the designer determines supplementary evidence requirements. || 用量乘體積不包含施工損失，也不代表有效反應比例；本例是材料估算，不能當成適用所有土層的配方。~Dosage times volume excludes execution losses and does not establish reacted fraction; this is a material estimate, not a recipe suitable for all soils.
每米攪拌轉數~Rotations per metre || 攪拌葉片在某深度作用的程度與轉速、升降速度及重複行程有關，每米轉數可比較機械暴露量。相同轉數不代表相同能量，扭矩、葉片形狀及土體阻力會改變混合效果；材料供應時序也必須與葉片通過時間同步。~Mixing exposure depends on rotation, vertical speed and repeated passes, and rotations per metre provide one process comparison. Equal counts do not imply equal energy because torque, blade geometry and soil resistance differ. Binder-delivery timing must also correspond to the interval when the blades pass through each layer. || 假設轉速n=30 rev/min、升速v=0.5 m/min，每米轉數n/v=60 rev/m~For rotation n=30 rev/min and vertical speed v=0.5 m/min, exposure n/v=60 rev/m || 同步記錄轉速、升降速度、扭矩及供料，按深度查低暴露區，再以芯樣均勻度驗證。~Synchronize rotation, vertical speed, torque and feed, identify low-exposure zones by depth, and verify them through core uniformity. || 平均每米轉數合格仍可能掩蓋停料或快速穿越夾層，留下未拌合土團與連續弱面。~An acceptable average rotation count can conceal feed interruption or rapid passage through a seam, leaving unmixed clods and weak planes. || 每米攪拌轉數越高，就一定有同比例的強度增加。~More rotations per metre necessarily increase strength proportionally. || 記錄應以共同時間及深度基準儲存，製程偏差由施工與地工負責人以試驗結果共同判定。~Store logs on common time and depth references; construction and geotechnical leads judge process deviations jointly against test evidence. || 每米轉數是運動學指標而非能量或品質標準，不能取代扭矩與取樣；此假設數字也不是現場設備設定建議。~Rotations per metre are kinematic rather than an energy or quality criterion and cannot replace torque and sampling; these assumed values are not recommended machine settings.
柱體積與連續性~Column volume and continuity || 名目柱徑與長度可估算改良體積，但葉片磨耗、土團及停料可能使有效截面小於理論值。幾何體積與膠結材用量應相互核對，卻不能互相替代驗證；不同深度的縮頸或斷層通常比整柱平均值更影響承載及止水。~Nominal diameter and length estimate treated volume, but blade wear, soil clods and feed interruption can reduce effective section. Geometry and dosage should reconcile without substituting for each other as evidence. Necking or discontinuity at one depth often matters more to bearing and sealing than the column-wide average. || 假設圓柱D=0.8 m、L=15 m，V=πD²L/4=7.54 m³~For a circular column D=0.8 m and L=15 m, V=πD²L/4=7.54 m³ || 核對工具尺寸與磨耗紀錄，配合取芯、揭露或核定連續性檢測，查找深度局部異常。~Verify tool dimensions and wear logs, combining cores, exposure or approved continuity investigations to locate depth-specific anomalies. || 工具磨耗未記錄會使柱體較小，柱群咬合與面積比不足，而總注入量仍可能看似正常。~Unrecorded tool wear creates smaller columns and inadequate overlap or area ratio even when total injected quantity appears normal. || 工具名目直徑就是每個深度都已證明的成品直徑。~Nominal tool diameter proves the finished diameter at every depth. || 施工設備尺寸變更須更新設計幾何與試驗計畫；地工設計者核准後才能沿用原柱距。~Equipment-size changes update design geometry and testing; the geotechnical designer approves continued use of the original spacing. || 圓柱體積假設截面均勻且長度可信，不含重疊扣除或土體膨脹；不能把總方量直接當有效改良方量。~Cylinder volume assumes uniform section and reliable length, excluding overlap deductions and ground expansion; total volume is not automatically effective treated volume.
攪拌柱重疊~Mixing-column overlap || 重疊柱列可形成剪力或止水屏障，但新舊柱交界的混合與齡期會影響接面。幾何上交疊不等於材料完全重新拌合，偏斜與工具避讓還可能減少深部交集；施工順序應與固化時間及連續性驗證共同設計。~Overlapping rows form shear or hydraulic barriers, but mixing and age at column interfaces govern continuity. Geometric intersection does not prove complete remixing, and deviation or tool interference can reduce deep overlap. Sequence therefore needs coordination with curing time and interface verification rather than geometry alone. || 假設有效D=0.8 m、中心距s=0.6 m，名目交疊o=D−s=0.20 m~For effective D=0.8 m and spacing s=0.6 m, nominal overlap o=D−s=0.20 m || 將柱位、孔斜與施工時間疊合，優先於交界取樣，確認接面強度及水力連續性。~Overlay column position, inclination and execution time, prioritizing interface samples to verify mechanical and hydraulic continuity. || 交界形成未混合薄帶時，單柱芯樣可全部合格，屏障仍沿接面滑移或漏水。~An unmixed interface seam can permit sliding or leakage even when all individual-column cores pass. || 相鄰柱有幾何交疊，就必定像單一整體一樣工作。~Geometrically overlapping columns necessarily act as one monolithic body. || 接面試驗位置和施工順序須納入驗收文件；地工設計者對深部最小交集作獨立審查。~Include interface-test locations and sequence in acceptance records; the geotechnical designer independently reviews the minimum effective deep intersection and its uncertainty. || 線性咬合只描述等徑平行柱，未含偏斜及材料齡期差；設計需對接面失效模式保留獨立證據。~Linear overlap describes equal parallel columns only, omitting deviation and age differences; interface failure mechanisms require independent supporting evidence.
等效地盤模數~Equivalent ground modulus || 改良柱與原土在剛性載重層下可能近似等應變，等效模數因此可用面積加權估計。此模型反映剛度而非強度，且原土排水條件及柱體開裂會改變模數；柔性路堤或端部沉陷不相容時不能直接套用。~Under a rigid load-distribution layer, columns and soil may approximately share strain, allowing an area-weighted equivalent modulus. The model concerns stiffness rather than strength, and drainage and column cracking change the moduli. It cannot be transferred directly to flexible embankments or incompatible toe settlement. || 假設面積比a=0.25、柱模數Ec=100 MPa、原土Es=10 MPa，Eeq=aEc+(1−a)Es=32.5 MPa~For area ratio a=0.25, Ec=100 MPa and Es=10 MPa, Eeq=aEc+(1−a)Es=32.5 MPa || 量測柱頂與柱間沉陷和壓力，檢查等應變假設，再以相應應力範圍的材料試驗比較。~Measure column-head and intervening-soil settlement and pressure, testing equal strain before comparison with material tests at matching stress levels. || 直接用室內小應變模數預測大荷載沉陷，可能高估剛度，讓實際沉陷及分力超出預期。~Using laboratory small-strain moduli for large-load settlement can overstate stiffness and mispredict movement and force sharing. || 面積加權模數越大就表示所有失效模式都更安全。~A larger area-weighted modulus improves safety for every failure mode. || 設計書須標明模數應變範圍與排水狀態；試驗不支持等應變時，由設計者改採互制模型。~State modulus strain range and drainage condition; where tests do not support equal strain, the designer adopts an interaction model. || 加權模數假設平行受力與共同應變，不適用串聯軟弱層；柱體抗剪、整體穩定與負載轉移層仍需分別檢查。~The weighted modulus assumes parallel loading and common strain, not weak layers in series; column shear, overall stability and load-transfer layers require separate checks.
殘餘強度~Residual strength || 固化土可能具有較高峰值強度但峰後脆性明顯，局部裂開後的殘餘能力影響荷載是否能安全轉移。只比較峰值會忽略施工擾動、地震或差異沉陷後的反應，試驗因此需要足夠變形範圍及完整應力應變曲線。~Stabilized soil may have high peak strength yet brittle post-peak behaviour, with residual resistance governing redistribution after cracking. Peak-only comparisons miss responses to disturbance, earthquakes or differential settlement. Testing therefore needs sufficient deformation range and complete stress-strain curves rather than terminating at the first peak. || 假設峰值qu=2 MPa、相應大應變殘餘qr=0.8 MPa，比值qr/qu=0.40~For peak qu=2 MPa and residual qr=0.8 MPa at a defined large strain, qr/qu=0.40 || 保存峰前峰後曲線、破壞面與試體含水，核對各試驗是否在相同應變及排水條件比較。~Retain pre- and post-peak curves, failure planes and specimen water content, comparing tests at consistent strain and drainage conditions. || 脆性柱體局部破壞後無法承接預期重分配，鄰柱可能連鎖超載，整體平均強度仍無法描述此問題。~A brittle column may not sustain assumed redistribution after local failure, causing neighbour overload that mean strength does not describe. || 固化土峰值強度達標就不必記錄峰後行為。~Compliant stabilized-soil peak strength makes post-peak behaviour irrelevant. || 對需承受大變形的改良體，材料與地工設計者應共同指定殘餘性能試驗及分析假設。~For treatment expected to undergo large deformation, materials and geotechnical designers jointly specify residual-performance testing and analysis assumptions. || 殘餘比依試驗型式及應變定義改變，不是通用韌性等級；單軸結果也不能直接代表圍壓下的剪切殘餘強度。~The residual ratio depends on test type and defined strain and is not a universal toughness class; unconfined results do not directly represent confined shear residual strength.
強度離散~Strength scatter || 深層攪拌品質受地層變化與混合程度影響，平均強度以外的離散性可揭示弱區風險。標準差須與取樣位置及試體數一起看；將不同土層混成一個統計族群，可能把可解釋的地質差異誤當隨機製程雜訊。~Deep-mixing quality reflects both strata and mixing, so scatter beyond mean strength reveals weak-zone risk. Standard deviation needs sampling locations and count for interpretation. Pooling distinct strata into one population may misclassify explainable geological differences as random process noise and hide systematic weaknesses. || 假設同一族群μ=1.6 MPa、標準差s=0.4 MPa，CV=s/μ=0.25~For one population with μ=1.6 MPa and standard deviation s=0.4 MPa, CV=s/μ=0.25 || 依土層、柱位及深度分組，將低強度與施工扭矩供料紀錄比對，保留無法取芯的區段。~Group results by stratum, column and depth, compare low strengths with torque and feed logs, and retain uncoreable intervals in the evidence set. || 弱層資料被其他高值稀釋，可能讓平均合格卻仍存在連續低強度面，影響整體穩定。~Strong results can dilute a weak layer statistically, leaving a continuous low-strength plane despite an acceptable overall mean. || 將不同地層全部平均，可以更準確代表最弱位置。~Averaging all strata gives a more accurate description of the weakest location. || 試驗與統計分組方式須事前核定；補測與補強由地工設計者按空間弱區決定，不任意剔除低值。~Approve testing and statistical grouping in advance; the geotechnical designer selects additional investigation and remedies from spatial weak zones without discarding low values arbitrarily. || 變異係數不直接提供特徵強度，仍需樣本數、分布及信賴程度；本值僅是合成資料的描述統計。~CV does not directly provide characteristic strength; sample count, distribution and confidence are still needed, and this value only describes synthetic data.
漿量與地表隆起~Slurry balance and heave || 注入漿液增加地層內物質，若排出路徑受限，可能造成隆起或孔壓增加。投入與回收體積差不能全當成有益改良量，還需區分原土體積變化及混合膨脹；鄰近管線對短時位移的容忍度可能比成品強度更早控制施工。~Injected slurry adds material to the ground and may cause heave or pore-pressure rise if escape paths are restricted. Input-return imbalance is not entirely beneficial treatment; separate native-soil volume change and mixing expansion. Nearby utilities may be governed by short-term movement before cured strength becomes relevant. || 假設注入Vin=5 m³、回收Vout=4.2 m³，體積差ΔV=0.8 m³~For injected Vin=5 m³ and recovered Vout=4.2 m³, volume imbalance ΔV=0.8 m³ || 同步記錄供回漿、地表水準及孔壓，核對儲槽延遲和材料密度，追查變形與量差是否同時。~Synchronize feed and returns with surface levels and pore pressure, checking tank delays and density and whether movement coincides with imbalance. || 把異常少返漿當成高效率，可能錯過堵塞引起的抬升，先損傷周邊資產再發現品質問題。~Interpreting unusually low returns as efficiency can miss blockage-induced heave, damaging neighbouring assets before quality problems are recognized. || 漿液沒有返出就表示全部留在正確位置且沒有副作用。~No slurry return means all material remains correctly placed without adverse effects. || 資產變形與量平衡需共用警戒機制；施工及地工負責人確認材料去向後才核准繼續。~Use a shared response mechanism for asset movement and volume balance; construction and geotechnical leads confirm material destination before approving continuation. || 體積差不等於地表隆起體積，還受地下水排出及土體重排影響；需用獨立測量證據確認變形機制。~Volume imbalance is not surface-heave volume because groundwater expulsion and soil rearrangement also contribute; independent measurements must establish the deformation mechanism.
複合層沉陷~Composite-layer settlement || 改良地盤的沉陷來自改良層壓縮及其下未處理土層，剛度提高不代表總沉陷必然很小。一維等效模數可初估指定層的壓縮量，但忽略側向變形與時間效應；移交時應確認實測沉陷發生在哪些深度，而非只比較地表總值。~Settlement includes compression of the treated layer and untreated ground below, so higher stiffness does not guarantee small total movement. A one-dimensional equivalent modulus estimates compression of a specified layer but excludes lateral deformation and time effects. Handover should identify settlement by depth rather than compare surface totals alone. || 假設均勻附加q=100 kPa、層厚H=10 m、相應一維模數M=32500 kPa，s=qH/M=0.0308 m~For uniform increment q=100 kPa, thickness H=10 m and corresponding constrained modulus M=32500 kPa, s=qH/M=0.0308 m || 使用分層沉陷計與孔壓資料，將改良層和下伏層分開比較，確認模數與應力區間一致。~Use layered settlement and pore-pressure instruments to separate treated and underlying layers, checking that modulus and stress range are consistent. || 只檢查改良柱壓縮可能漏掉下伏軟層，完成後仍持續沉陷並損傷剛性結構或管線。~Checking column compression alone misses soft ground below, allowing continued settlement that damages rigid structures or utilities. || 改良柱很硬就代表整個地盤的長期沉陷可以忽略。~Stiff treated columns make long-term settlement of the entire ground negligible. || 交接須列未處理層及殘餘沉陷假設；地工設計者確認觀測趨勢與後續荷載計畫後才結案。~Handover identifies untreated layers and residual-settlement assumptions; the geotechnical designer confirms observed trends and future loading before closeout. || 此處M明定為相應一維模數，不能無條件以楊氏模數代入；若沿深度應力或剛度變化，應分層積分。~Here M is the corresponding constrained modulus and cannot automatically be replaced by Young's modulus; variable stress or stiffness requires layered integration.
'''),'原創教學例：原土水質量Mw=60 kg、乾土Ms=100 kg，含水比w=Mw/Ms=60%。若水量增加10%至66 kg而乾土不變，含水比變成66%，增加六個百分點，也就是相對增加10%。此結果不是飽和度，也不能直接推論固化後強度減少多少。配比還需計入新增漿液水、乾膠結材及土體反應性，並以相同養護及試驗方法比較。工程師應把含水比變化帶回材料試驗矩陣，避免用固定水泥量掩蓋不同土層的差異。~Original teaching example: native soil contains Mw=60 kg of water and Ms=100 kg of dry soil, giving w=Mw/Ms=60%. Increasing water mass by 10% to 66 kg while dry mass remains fixed raises water content to 66%, six percentage points or a 10% relative increase. This is not saturation and does not directly predict the resulting strength reduction. Mixture assessment also includes added slurry water, dry binder and soil reactivity under comparable curing and testing. Feed the changed water content into the laboratory matrix rather than assuming a fixed cement dosage neutralizes differences between strata.',['keller-mixing','fhwa-ground','geo-site'],['Crossrail聯絡通道：地盤處理選擇比較~Crossrail cross passages: ground-treatment selection comparison','倫敦哈利街地下室：改良與樁基礎比較~Harley Street basement: treatment versus piled foundations'])

add('b188','補償灌漿的變形回饋、注入效率與延遲~Compensation-grouting movement feedback, efficiency and delay','補償灌漿透過受控的地層變形降低隧道施工對資產的沉陷影響，其目標是控制差異變形而非追求最大抬升。本課把沉陷槽、注入效率、孔位誤差、有效應力及回饋延遲連成模型，再檢查結構角變形、曲率與停止注入後的殘餘反應。~Compensation grouting controls ground deformation to reduce settlement effects from tunnelling, targeting differential movement rather than maximum heave. The course connects settlement troughs, injection efficiency, bore position, effective stress and feedback delay, then evaluates structural distortion, curvature and residual movement after injection stops.',compact(r'''
沉陷槽形狀~Settlement-trough shape || 隧道引起的地表沉陷可用高斯形狀作第一近似，最大沉陷與槽寬共同決定影響範圍。補償灌漿的監測應涵蓋整個敏感資產而非只追最大值，因為槽邊坡度與曲率可能更影響建物；分層地盤或多隧道會偏離單一對稱槽。~A Gaussian shape approximates tunnel-induced surface settlement, with peak and width jointly defining the influence zone. Compensation monitoring should cover the sensitive asset rather than chase the peak alone because edge slope and curvature may govern building response. Layering and multiple tunnels can depart from one symmetric trough. || 假設smax=20 mm、槽寬參數i=10 m、位置x=10 m，s=smax exp[−x²/(2i²)]=12.1 mm~For smax=20 mm, trough parameter i=10 m and x=10 m, s=smax exp[−x²/(2i²)]=12.1 mm || 用跨越資產的測線擬合峰值與槽寬，保留未參與配適測點驗證，檢查不對稱及局部突變。~Fit peak and width from survey lines spanning the asset, retaining unused points for validation and checking asymmetry and local discontinuities. || 只控制中央沉陷可能讓槽邊差異變形增大，建物出現裂縫時總沉陷仍可能不大。~Controlling central settlement alone can increase edge distortion, allowing building cracking while total settlement remains modest. || 最大沉陷控制住就代表所有建物位置都安全。~Controlling peak settlement guarantees safety at every building location. || 變形目標應由資產結構評估制定；監測及灌漿設計者共同確認控制區與獨立驗證點。~The asset assessment defines movement targets; monitoring and grouting designers jointly establish control areas and independent validation points. || 高斯式是經驗形狀而非唯一機理，不能直接推算灌漿量；建物剛度、基礎及分層地盤均須另外考量。~The Gaussian expression is an empirical shape rather than a unique mechanism and does not directly determine grout volume; building stiffness, foundations and layering require separate consideration.
注入抬升效率~Injection-heave efficiency || 注入漿液一部分填充孔隙或裂縫，另一部分造成土體位移，故注入體積不等於資產抬升體積。效率會隨既有灌漿、應力及排水改變，必須由已觀測反應校正；把所有留存量視為有效補償，可能導致過量注入與隆起。~Some grout fills voids or fractures while another part displaces soil, so injected volume does not equal asset-heave volume. Efficiency changes with prior treatment, stress and drainage and must be updated from observations. Treating all retained grout as useful compensation can cause excessive injection and unintended uplift. || 假設估算抬升體積Vh=0.6 m³、注入Vg=2 m³，表觀效率η=Vh/Vg=0.30~For inferred heave volume Vh=0.6 m³ and injection Vg=2 m³, apparent efficiency η=Vh/Vg=0.30 || 將地表位移積分範圍、注入量與時間對齊，檢查資產外的變形是否被漏算，保留孔壓資料。~Align the surface-integration area, injection volume and time, checking omitted movement outside the asset and retaining pore-pressure observations. || 用固定效率追求補償可能在地盤變硬後造成過度隆起，或在漏失時持續注入而未達目標。~Using fixed efficiency can cause excessive heave after ground stiffens or continued injection without compensation when losses occur. || 注入一立方公尺漿液就一定有一立方公尺地表抬升。~One cubic metre of grout necessarily produces one cubic metre of surface heave. || 效率估算應保留空間及時間範圍；地工設計者確認反應改變原因後，才調整補償方案。~Document the spatial and temporal bounds of efficiency estimates; the geotechnical designer confirms why response changed before revising compensation. || 表觀效率可能受觀測區域及其他沉陷影響，不能當成固定材料常數；體積平衡還需考慮壓縮與漿液外逸。~Apparent efficiency depends on observation extent and concurrent settlement, so it is not a material constant; compression and grout escape also affect the balance.
袖閥管定位~Sleeve-pipe location || 灌漿管位置控制注入與資產間的幾何關係，長孔小角度偏差可把有效區移到不同地層或接近既有設施。只知道孔口位置不足以定位各袖閥，必須建立全長軌跡，並與地下資產資料的不確定範圍一起比較。~Pipe location defines the geometry between injection and assets. Small angular errors over long bores can shift the effective zone into different strata or toward existing infrastructure. Collar position alone does not locate each sleeve port; full trajectories must be compared with the uncertainty envelope of buried assets. || 假設管長L=20 m、方向誤差θ=1°，側向偏移δ=Lsinθ=0.349 m~For pipe length L=20 m and angular error θ=1°, lateral offset δ=Lsinθ=0.349 m || 用核定孔斜量測及袖閥深度紀錄建立三維位置，核對管線調查精度，檢查注入反應是否符合所在層位。~Build three-dimensional port positions from approved deviation surveys and depth logs, checking utility-survey accuracy and whether response matches the intended stratum. || 袖閥偏位可能把漿液送到資產下方的不利弱面，形成局部抬升或直接接觸地下設施。~A misplaced port can feed an adverse plane beneath an asset, producing localized heave or direct interaction with buried infrastructure. || 孔口放樣正確就表示所有袖閥都在設計位置。~Correct collar setting-out proves every sleeve port is correctly positioned. || 注入區與資產距離須以實測軌跡確認；接近敏感界面時由資產管理者及地工設計者共同核定。~Confirm injection-to-asset distance from measured trajectories; the asset owner and geotechnical designer jointly approve conditions near sensitive interfaces. || 固定角誤差式不是全孔軌跡模型，實際曲線與孔口誤差會疊加；不可把名目深度當唯一空間座標。~The fixed-angle expression is not a full trajectory model; curvature and collar errors accumulate, and nominal depth is not a unique spatial coordinate.
注入與有效應力~Injection and effective stress || 灌漿提高局部流體壓力時，土骨架有效應力可能下降，並觸發裂縫張開或土體位移。總應力也可能隨資產約束及灌漿反力改變，因此不能把泵端壓力直接代入孔壓；需要辨別管路損失、注入點與土中實際壓力。~Rising local fluid pressure can reduce skeleton effective stress and initiate fracture opening or movement. Total stress can also change through asset restraint and grout reaction, so pump pressure cannot be substituted directly for pore pressure. Distinguish line losses, injection-point pressure and the pressure actually measured in the soil. || 假設同一方向總應力σ=180 kPa、土中孔壓u=80 kPa，σ′=σ−u=100 kPa~For total stress σ=180 kPa and soil pore pressure u=80 kPa in the same direction, σ′=σ−u=100 kPa || 對照泵端及注入點壓力與鄰近孔壓計，量測管路損失，將資產位移及時間延遲一併記錄。~Compare pump and port pressures with nearby piezometers, assess line losses, and record asset movement and response delay together. || 把泵壓當土壓會錯估劈裂條件，可能持續提高注入而在遠端弱面形成非預期變形。~Treating pump pressure as soil pressure misstates fracture conditions and can encourage continued injection that moves an unintended distant weak plane. || 泵端壓力就等於所有注入深度的實際孔隙水壓。~Pump pressure equals actual pore pressure at every injection depth. || 壓力量測位置與損失修正須列於方案；地工及設備負責人共同確認資料意義後才調整控制邊界。~State pressure locations and loss corrections in the plan; geotechnical and equipment leads confirm interpretation before control boundaries are changed. || 此有效應力式不直接給劈裂壓力，還需最小主應力、抗拉及界面條件；教學壓力不是現場注入設定。~Effective stress does not directly give fracture pressure, which also depends on minimum principal stress, tension and interfaces; these pressures are not field injection settings.
回饋延遲~Feedback delay || 補償灌漿的控制迴路包含感測、傳輸、判讀與設備反應，每個環節的延遲會使已發生的位移晚到控制者眼前。若持續注入速度快於可觀察反應，容易超越目標；延遲應與地層本身的反應時間分開辨識。~The control loop includes sensing, transmission, interpretation and equipment response, each delaying the movement information reaching the controller. If injection continues faster than observable response, compensation may overshoot. System delay must be distinguished from the physical response time of the ground rather than combining them into one unexplained lag. || 假設感測5 s、傳輸3 s、判讀與反應12 s，總延遲τ=5+3+12=20 s~For sensing 5 s, transmission 3 s and interpretation-response 12 s, total delay τ=20 s || 使用共同時鐘追蹤注入事件與感測到達時間，模擬訊號中斷，確認遺失資料不會被當成零位移。~Use a common clock to trace injection events and data arrival, testing signal loss so missing data are not interpreted as zero movement. || 資料延遲或凍結時仍持續控制，可能造成過度抬升；平滑濾波也會增加隱藏延遲。~Continued control during delayed or frozen data can overcompensate; smoothing filters can introduce additional hidden delay. || 監測畫面仍有數字，就表示資料一定即時有效。~Numbers remaining on a monitoring display mean the data are current and valid. || 控制計畫須設定資料新鮮度與失聯停留點；監測及施工負責人確認復原資料後才解除限制。~Control plans define data-freshness and communication-loss hold points; monitoring and construction leads confirm recovered data before restrictions are lifted. || 延遲相加假設環節串聯，並行處理需另建時間模型；二十秒不是允許延遲標準，也不取代資產反應分析。~Adding delays assumes serial stages; parallel processing needs a different timing model, and twenty seconds is neither an allowable delay nor a substitute for asset-response analysis.
建物角變形~Building angular distortion || 補償的目標通常是限制資產差異變位，單純追求回復地表標高可能反而造成局部反曲。兩點沉陷差可估平均角變形，但建物剛度及基礎連續性會改變力流；原有裂縫與脆性接頭需有個別的變形評估。~Compensation generally targets differential asset movement, and restoring surface elevation alone can produce adverse local reverse curvature. Two-point settlement difference estimates mean angular distortion, but building stiffness and foundation continuity change force paths. Existing cracks and brittle connections require their own movement assessment rather than a generic surface target. || 假設差異位移Δs=3 mm、測點距L=6 m=6000 mm，β=Δs/L=0.0005 rad~For differential movement Δs=3 mm over L=6 m=6000 mm, β=Δs/L=0.0005 rad || 量測資產本體而非只量附近地表，結合傾度與裂縫計分辨剛體轉動及真實畸變。~Measure the asset itself rather than nearby ground alone, combining tilt and crack gauges to distinguish rigid-body rotation from actual distortion. || 過度補償一個測點可能讓鄰跨產生更大差異變位，總沉陷變小卻造成新的裂縫。~Overcompensating one point can increase differential movement in the next span, reducing total settlement while causing new cracks. || 只要把每個地表點抬回原高程，建物內力就會減少。~Returning every surface point to its original elevation necessarily reduces building forces. || 資產變形控制區需由結構評估者核定；補償決策應同時檢查相鄰測點，不能只追單點目標。~The structural assessor approves asset-control zones; compensation decisions check neighbouring points rather than pursuing one isolated target. || 平均角變形不是通用損傷指標，需依跨距、剛度與既有狀態解釋；剛體傾斜應與構件彎曲分離。~Mean angular distortion is not a universal damage indicator; interpret it with span, stiffness and existing condition, separating rigid tilt from member bending.
效率隨歷程變化~History-dependent efficiency || 前次灌漿可能填滿可進入空隙或改變地層應力，使後續相同注入量產生不同位移。效率變化是地盤狀態更新的訊號，不能直接把較高效率當進度優勢；反應突然增強可能意味抬升更局部或注入路徑轉移。~Previous grouting may fill accessible voids or alter stress, changing movement from the same later injection volume. Efficiency change signals evolving ground state rather than an automatic productivity benefit. A stronger response can mean more localized heave or a shifted injection path, requiring renewed spatial interpretation. || 假設初期效率η₁=0.30、後期η₂=0.45，倍率η₂/η₁=1.5~For initial efficiency η₁=0.30 and later η₂=0.45, response-efficiency ratio η₂/η₁=1.5 || 以相同觀測範圍和時間窗比較各輪注入，檢查位移形狀是否改變，而非只計體積比。~Compare rounds over the same observation area and time window, examining movement shape as well as the volume ratio. || 沿用早期效率可能讓後續補償過量，資產局部隆起或接縫反向開合而未被平均值識別。~Retaining early efficiency can overcompensate later rounds, creating local uplift or reversed joint movement hidden by averages. || 一次試驗得到的補償效率可以固定用到工程結束。~One trial compensation efficiency remains valid until project completion. || 每輪回饋需保留歷史狀態與反應差異；設計者審查效率變化後更新模型，且保留舊版本供追溯。~Retain state history and response differences for each round; the designer updates the model after reviewing efficiency change and preserves earlier versions. || 兩個效率必須採相同量測定義才可相除，否則倍率可能只是觀測範圍改變；它不直接給出下一輪施工參數。~Efficiencies require identical measurement definitions before comparison; otherwise the ratio may reflect a changed observation area and does not prescribe the next operational settings.
結構曲率~Structural curvature || 連續建物或管線受到地盤變形時，曲率比單一斜率更直接反映彎曲需求。兩段轉角差除以距離可估局部曲率，資料解析度及測點間距卻會影響結果；把粗間距測點插值成平滑曲線，可能漏掉剛度突變處的集中彎曲。~For continuous buildings or pipes, curvature reflects bending demand more directly than one slope. Rotation difference over distance estimates local curvature, but resolution and spacing influence the result. Interpolating sparse points into a smooth curve can miss concentrated bending at stiffness transitions and produce false confidence in compatibility. || 假設轉角差Δθ=0.002 rad、間距L=4 m，κ≈Δθ/L=0.0005 m⁻¹~For rotation difference Δθ=0.002 rad over L=4 m, κ≈Δθ/L=0.0005 m⁻¹ || 結合水準、傾度與結構斷面位置，檢查曲率估算對測點間距的敏感度，保留原始誤差。~Combine levelling, tilt and section locations, checking sensitivity of curvature estimates to sensor spacing and retaining original uncertainty. || 測點太疏可能漏掉局部彎曲，脆性管線或既有接頭先損傷，而平均沉陷仍在目標內。~Sparse points can miss local bending that damages brittle utilities or existing joints while mean settlement stays within target. || 兩點傾斜角很小，就能保證中間沒有局部高曲率。~A small two-point tilt guarantees no high curvature between them. || 敏感接頭與剛度變化處應設專門測點；資產結構設計者核准曲率與應變的對應關係。~Provide dedicated measurements at sensitive joints and stiffness changes; the asset structural designer approves the relation between curvature and strain. || 有限差分曲率是假設變形平滑的近似，接縫可集中轉動時不應當連續梁；材料應變還須乘中性軸距離。~Finite-difference curvature assumes smooth deformation; joints with concentrated rotation are not continuous beams, and material strain also requires distance from the neutral axis.
小訊號反應模型~Small-signal response model || 以既有小幅注入與量測可建立局部線性增益，供比較控制敏感度，但地盤劈裂與接觸開閉使系統本質非線性。模型只能在相近狀態及小增量內使用，不能從一次反應直接推算大體積注入，更不能把理論控制值當作現場施作指令。~Small observed injections can establish a local linear gain for comparing control sensitivity, but fracture growth and opening or closing contact make the ground nonlinear. The model applies only near the calibrated state and for small increments. One response cannot justify large-volume extrapolation or turn a theoretical control quantity into field instructions. || 純合成控制示例假設局部增益g=2 mm/L、微小輸入ΔV=0.5 L，預測Δs=gΔV=1 mm~In a purely synthetic control example, local gain g=2 mm/L and small input ΔV=0.5 L give Δs=gΔV=1 mm || 用未參與辨識的小幅資料檢查增益，對比位置、時間及孔壓，確認反應沒有改變機制。~Check the gain against small observations excluded from identification, comparing location, timing and pore pressure to confirm the mechanism remains unchanged. || 把線性增益外推至大注入量，可能因新裂縫或局部抬升而產生遠超預期的變形。~Extrapolating linear gain to large injection can activate new fractures or localized heave and produce movements far beyond prediction. || 一次注入得到的線性增益可精確預測任何後續用量。~A linear gain from one injection predicts any later volume exactly. || 現場參數需由核定試驗與資產限制決定；控制模型由地工設計者確認適用區間及失效停留點。~Field parameters follow approved trials and asset constraints; the geotechnical designer confirms the control model range and failure hold points. || 算例數字完全合成，只用來說明增益與輸入單位，不是推薦注入量；一旦狀態改變，需重新辨識或改採非線性模型。~The numbers are wholly synthetic and illustrate gain and input units rather than recommended injection quantity; changed state requires re-identification or a nonlinear model.
停注後反應~Post-injection response || 停止注入後，地盤仍可能因孔壓消散、漿材固化及隧道持續開挖而移動，因此控制不應在閥門關閉時結束。殘餘位移與時間的關係有助分辨短時回彈及長期沉陷，但需扣除其他施工事件並保持監測基準不變。~Movement can continue after injection through pore-pressure dissipation, curing and ongoing tunnelling, so control should not end when a valve closes. Residual movement over time helps distinguish rebound from longer-term settlement, but other construction events must be separated and the monitoring datum kept consistent. || 假設停注後位移由1.0 mm至1.4 mm、間隔4 day，平均變化率v=0.4/4=0.1 mm/day~For post-injection movement from 1.0 mm to 1.4 mm over four days, mean rate v=0.4/4=0.1 mm/day || 持續記錄位移、孔壓及隧道進度，檢查停止注入後的相位及反向移動，保留資料到核定穩定條件。~Continue movement, pore-pressure and tunnel-progress records, checking phase and reversal after injection until approved stabilization conditions are demonstrated. || 太早結束監測會漏掉延遲抬升或回沉，資產可能在施工團隊撤離後才出現接縫問題。~Ending monitoring early misses delayed uplift or renewed settlement, leaving asset joints to develop problems after the construction team leaves. || 停止灌漿後，地盤位移也會立即完全停止。~Ground movement stops completely as soon as grouting stops. || 交接需明定停止注入後的監測責任與結案條件；資產及地工負責人共同確認殘餘反應。~Handover defines post-injection monitoring responsibility and closure conditions; asset and geotechnical leads jointly confirm residual response. || 四天平均率不代表最終沉陷或峰值速率，且需要固定位置與方向；本例不能取代專案監測終止判據。~A four-day mean does not establish final settlement or peak rate and requires fixed location and direction; it cannot replace project monitoring closure criteria.
'''),'原創教學例：假設高斯沉陷槽smax=20 mm、寬度參數i=10 m，在x=10 m位置，s=20 exp(−10²/(2×10²))=12.13 mm。若只增加峰值10%至22 mm，槽寬不變，同位置沉陷為13.34 mm，也增加10%。這個結果描述固定形狀的沉陷場，不是所需灌漿量；實際建物剛度、注入效率、孔位與反應延遲會影響補償。工程師應檢查全資產角變形與曲率，並以獨立測點驗證槽形，不能只把單點抬回原位當成完成。~Original teaching example: assume a Gaussian trough with smax=20 mm and width parameter i=10 m. At x=10 m, s=20 exp(−10²/(2×10²))=12.13 mm. Increase only the peak by 10% to 22 mm while keeping width fixed: movement at the same position becomes 13.34 mm, also up 10%. This describes a fixed-shape settlement field, not required grout quantity. Building stiffness, injection efficiency, port position and response delay affect actual compensation. Check distortion and curvature across the whole asset and validate trough shape at independent points rather than defining completion by restoring one point alone.',['keller-compensation','fhwa-ground','geo-site'],['Crossrail邦德街：資產變形比較~Crossrail Bond Street: asset-movement comparison','Crossrail利物浦街：沉陷槽比較~Crossrail Liverpool Street: settlement-trough comparison'])
if __name__=='__main__': write()
